  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds keep-with-next headings (H1-H3), widow/orphan control, links, document language/metadata, opt-in TrueType kerning, caller-supplied Thai word boundaries, CMYK JPEG and more PNG formats, plus canvas, image-scaling and pagination fixes. Every PDF now carries /ID and font descriptors and some page breaks change, so output differs from 0.2.0-alpha.3. The HarfBuzz adapter is not included. See RELEASE-NOTES.md in the package.",
